<title>JAPAN: Shin-Daiwa Kogyo - 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Shin-Daiwa Kogyo - 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31,1997</p>
<p>    (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			(three months)		 (full year)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.25		vs	   18.11</p>
<p> Operating	  187    million	  vs	  927    million</p>
<p> Current	    163    million	  vs	  521    million</p>
<p> Net		   75    million	  vs	  210    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.15 yen	  vs	    8.81 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Ord div		1.50 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shin-Daiwa Kogyo Co Ltd is leading manufacturer</p>
<p>of electric motor and engine chain saws. The latest results</p>
<p>were for about three months to March 31, 1997 from December</p>
<p>21, 1996, because the company changed the business term.</p>
</text>
